    "blocks_g6VtBW": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_19f144a_BAgRLn": {
          "type": "editorial--staggered-typography",
          "settings": {
            "line_1_text": "The one who is",
            "line_1_alignment": "left",
            "line_1_offset": 155,
            "line_2_text": "nearly impossible",
            "line_2_alignment": "center",
            "line_2_offset": 0,
            "line_3_text": "to shop for",
            "line_3_alignment": "center",
            "line_3_offset": 200,
            "body_text": "<p>Every friend group has one person who is nearly impossible to shop for. They already own what they want, care more about quality than quantity, and will<br/>absolutely return whatever misses. A <a href=\"/collections/unisex\" title=\"Unisex\">unisex fragrance</a> is the smartest move here, since it skips the guesswork of gendered marketing altogether. Cool Alpine, inspired by Silver Mountain Water by Creed, is clean and universally flattering enough that it rarely misses, whoever ends up opening it, which makes it the closest thing to a safe pick that still feels like an actual gift instead of a placeholder.</p>",
            "line_1_size": 40,
            "line_2_size": 55,
            "line_3_size": 40,
            "body_size": 22,
            "line_2_margin_top": 40,
            "line_3_margin_top": -14,
            "header_spacing": 40,
            "body_max_width": 900,
            "section_padding_top": 60,
            "section_padding_bottom": 60,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_AUBiD6": {
          "type": "editorial--text-section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Practical Part",
            "heading_size": 50,
            "heading_size_mobile": 32,
            "heading_line_height": 1,
            "heading_color": "#121212",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 50,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 30,
            "column_1_text": "<p>Concentration matters more than the box it comes in when it comes to how thoughtful a gift feels once it is actually unwrapped. An EDP that lasts the whole day reads as a lot more thoughtful than a three-piece set nobody requested, and it is a fraction of the cost to get right. Skip the oversized gift box. Put the money into the actual fragrance instead and check the concentration before you check how good<br/>the packaging looks.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>The part that actually matters, more than the fragrance itself sometimes, is telling them why you picked it. A card that says this made me think of you does more work than an expensive box ever could, because it proves you were paying attention instead of shopping under pressure at the last minute. That is really the entire point of sorting by personality in the first place.</p>",
            "body_size": 20,
            "body_size_mobile": 14,
            "body_line_height": 1.6,
            "body_color": "#000000",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 60,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1000,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
